  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Tax Administration Forum (ATAF) for Analytical Work &amp; consolidation Meeting 2009-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A grant agreement between the Bank and ATAF was established to study the current state of tax policies and systems in Africa; support the legal establishment of ATAF and contribute to the initial council meeting in Tunis in 2009. In this regard, the Bank&#x2019;s strategic partnership with ATAF has strengthened the domestic resources mobilization, fiscal self-reliance and capacity development agenda in Africa. In this regard, ATAF has succeeded in increasing its profile and attracting other development partners in line with the OECD&#x2019;s DAC recommendation to support ATAF.  Approved: CAD 171,190 (disbursed CAD 85,595).</narrative>
  </description>
